   "title": "Eenie Meenie Minie You",
   "quote": "Eenie meenie minie you! / WHOO! Not me! ...Gohan? / Wait! My-turn-my-turn-MY-TURN!",
   "line_start": 18,
   "line_end": 27
  },
  {
   "start": 91.5,
   "end": 120.9,
   "title": "Aneurysm of Sheer Stupidity",
   "quote": "Yes, just... just an aneurysm out of sheer stupidity... / Nine minutes, eighteen seconds. Happiest... moment... of... my life...!",
   "line_start": 31,
   "line_end": 41
  },
  {
   "start": 120.5,
   "end": 139.9,
   "title": "Destructo Disk",
   "quote": "Get ready for my... DESTRUCTO DISK! / Laaaaaaame…",
   "line_start": 42,
   "line_end": 47
  },
  {
   "start": 140.5,
   "end": 160.9,
   "title": "A Frisbee, Vegeta!",
   "quote": "On second thought, catch it. Catch it with your teeth. / Yaaay! Like a doggie! / Riiicolaa-- ohhh GODDAMMIT!!",
   "line_start": 48,
   "line_end": 56
  },
  {
   "start": 216.0,
   "end": 248.0,
   "title": "I'ma Firing My BLARRRGH",
   "quote": "Vegeta, look. I’ma firing my BLARRRGH! / 'Wait a second... Why didn’t I just grab him?'",
   "line_start": 81,
   "line_end": 92
  },
  {
   "start": 274.6,
   "end": 307.7,
   "title": "Why Didn't You DODGE?!",
   "quote": "Why... didn't... you... DOOOOOOOOODGE?!?!",
   "line_start": 103,
   "line_end": 110
  },
  {
   "start": 309.5,
   "end": 341.8,
   "title": "Bitch, I Ain't Goin' Nowhere",
   "quote": "Bitch, I ain't goin' nowhere. / Pecking order!",
   "line_start": 113,
   "line_end": 121
  },
